            "verseId": "2CO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.20.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mahendo 20:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi nriphofika mudzi wa Tirowa ili nikatangaze habari nono kuhusu Jesu, Mlungu achinipha nafwasi nono sana ya kuhenda hivyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela kala nina wasiwasi kpwa sababu ya mwenehu Tito, ambaye kala kadzangbwefika. Hipho nálaga nchiuka kuphiya Makedonia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela nahumshukuruni Mlungu ambaye chila wakati anahulongoza kusherekeya ushindi wa Jesu. Mlungu nkuhumira swiswi kueneza chila phatu marifwa kuhusu Jesu dza mafuha ga kunukato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Swiswi kpwa Mlungu ni dza kungu nono ya Jesu inayoenea kahi za atu anaookolwa na atu anaoangamika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa atu anaookoka, hunanuka kungu nono irehayo uzima, ela kpwa atu anaoangamika, swiswi hunanuka lovu rireharo chifo. Ela ni ani awezaye kushiriki mambo higo? Takuna hata mmwenga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana tahutangaza ujumbe wa Mlungu ili huphahe pesa, kama atu anjina ahendavyo. Ela hunagomba moyo kutsuka mbere za Mlungu, naswi hunagomba kpwa uwezo huriohewa ni Jesu kama atu ariohumwa kula kpwa Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
